# Data — large binary / sensitive
data/
!data/cpd_profiles/
# Side 5 jurisdiction evidence maps. Small, reviewed, version-controlled
# configuration — country offices correct these, so their history matters.
# Git will not descend into an excluded directory, so these negations are a
# statement of intent; the files are added explicitly, as cpd_profiles was.
!data/evidence_maps/
*.db

# Sensitive ground-truth (contains case details)
prosecuted_cases.json

